job_description:
Looking for reliable partners who may be interested in long term partnership in field of AI Automation development.

I am preparing for the test launch of my AI automation agency on the Ukrainian market. This market is very favorable for starting such a business for a number of reasons. I have quite extensive knowledge in the topic of business automation, including the use of artificial intelligence, and limited experience with some solutions that allow the creation of automation.

I am looking for experienced masters of AI automation of business processes who are interested in working on a permanent basis, on a project basis. On my side is the search for clients, sales, communication with clients, accounting and project management. From you, I expect high-quality and timely execution of the development and implementation of automation for my clients. As well as the ability to quickly join the work for technical support work.

If you are interested in such cooperation, please respond so that we can discuss the details.

I am most interested in the following points at work:

- your experience, examples of working projects, your skills and opportunities for creating automations;

- your pricing policy and how it is formed;

- do you have similar work experience, and if so, what positive and negative moments did you encounter? Whatever you want to repeat, and what you expect from me as a customer;

- are you ready to get acquainted with the local products of the Ukrainian market? Ukrainian businesses widely use global services, but also often use local CRM systems and certain local services, and their capabilities should be taken into account when planning integrations;

- I would like to discuss in more detail the specific services used for automation, if you have experience with them, to understand how to use them optimally from the point of view of costs and productivity.
